OS-01: narrates → F2, HV-05; serves → OBJ-01.

OS-02: narrates → F2, HV-02, HV-08; serves → OBJ-03, OBJ-06.

OS-03: narrates → F6, HV-01, HV-08; serves → OBJ-05, OBJ-09.
